{%- comment -%}
  DIAGNOSIS (re-confirmed this round, same root cause as before — see docs/build-progress.md):
  config/settings_data.json has no footer menu assignments at all, so footer_jewellery_menu /
  footer_house_menu / footer_client_care_menu / footer_information_menu are genuinely blank. The
  Liquid correctly hid each column when its menu was unset — but with all four unset and no
  fallback, the whole navigation area had nothing to show. Confirmed: not a CSS visibility bug (no
  display:none/opacity:0 ever targeted the grid), not a wrong-condition bug, not a section-group
  issue (this is a plain static section, not a section group) — genuinely empty settings with no
  fallback content.

  FINAL RULE — navigation must never fully disappear: each of the four groups now has priority
  1) the merchant-selected Shopify menu, 2) safe fallback links built only from resources
  confirmed to exist (collections/pages/blogs/policies checked via Liquid's own existence tests —
  `collections['handle']`, `pages['handle']`, `blogs['handle']`, `shop.*_policy` all resolve to
  blank/nil if the resource doesn't exist, so nothing broken is ever rendered), 3) an individual
  fallback item simply doesn't render if its destination doesn't exist — never a placeholder or
  guessed URL. A merchant-selected menu always overrides the fallback entirely for that group.

  Formal identity restructured per this round's explicit hierarchy: the Master Signature (House
  Seal + wordmark, composed) is now the footer's own opening moment, alongside "Sculpted for a
  lifetime." — previously this line and the Master Signature lived only in the homepage's separate
  closing section above the real <footer> (see the clarification in an earlier report); this round
  deliberately brings both into the footer itself, per the explicit new structure. The plain
  horizontal wordmark moves to the bottom utility row as the smaller, secondary mark, and the small
  House Seal remains the tiny final mark — no identity element repeated without a clear role.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign mark_mode = section.settings.logo_scheme

  assign has_jewellery_menu = false
  if section.settings.footer_jewellery_menu != blank
    assign has_jewellery_menu = true
  endif
  assign has_house_menu = false
  if section.settings.footer_house_menu != blank
    assign has_house_menu = true
  endif
  assign has_client_care_menu = false
  if section.settings.footer_client_care_menu != blank
    assign has_client_care_menu = true
  endif
  assign has_information_menu = false
  if section.settings.footer_information_menu != blank
    assign has_information_menu = true
  endif

  assign has_any_menu = false
  if has_jewellery_menu or has_house_menu or has_client_care_menu or has_information_menu
    assign has_any_menu = true
  endif

  # The live "Necklaces" collection's actual Shopify handle is misspelled ("neckalces" — see
  # docs/merchant-actions-required.md); checked here as a second-tier fallback only, purely so
  # this navigation doesn't stay broken while that's corrected upstream. Never renamed here.
  assign necklaces_collection = collections['necklaces'] | default: collections['neckalces']

  # Journal is treated as present only when the blog actually has published articles — matching
  # the homepage Journal section's own rule (see caviera-journal.liquid) that a blog resource
  # existing with zero articles still doesn't count as real content to link to. Computed once here
  # and reused below so the site-wide has_any_fallback check and the House column's own fallback
  # stay consistent with each other.
  assign house_journal = blank
  if blogs['news'] != blank and blogs['news'].articles.size > 0
    assign house_journal = blogs['news']
  elsif blogs['journal'] != blank and blogs['journal'].articles.size > 0
    assign house_journal = blogs['journal']
  endif

  assign has_any_fallback = false
  if collections['rings'] != blank or collections['earrings'] != blank or necklaces_collection != blank or collections['bracelets'] != blank
    assign has_any_fallback = true
  endif
  if pages['about-caviera'] != blank or pages['the-house'] != blank or pages['craftsmanship'] != blank or pages['bespoke'] != blank or house_journal != blank
    assign has_any_fallback = true
  endif
  if pages['contact'] != blank or pages['faq'] != blank or pages['shipping'] != blank or pages['returns'] != blank or pages['care'] != blank
    assign has_any_fallback = true
  endif
  if shop.privacy_policy != blank or shop.terms_of_service != blank or shop.refund_policy != blank or shop.shipping_policy != blank
    assign has_any_fallback = true
  endif

  assign show_nav = false
  if has_any_menu or has_any_fallback
    assign show_nav = true
  endif
-%}
<footer class="caviera-footer" data-scheme="{{ section.settings.color_scheme }}">
  {%- if section.settings.show_master_signature -%}
    <div class="container caviera-footer__signature">
      {%- if section.settings.master_heading != blank -%}<p class="caviera-footer__signature-heading heading-h2">{{ section.settings.master_heading }}</p>{%- endif -%}
      <div class="caviera-footer__signature-mark">
        {%- render 'caviera-master-signature', mode: mark_mode, width: 240 -%}
      </div>
      {%- if section.settings.statement != blank -%}
        <p class="caviera-footer__statement body-text">{{ section.settings.statement }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
    <span class="caviera-footer__rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  {%- endif -%}

  <div class="container caviera-footer__top">
    {%- if show_nav -%}
      <nav class="caviera-footer__columns" aria-label="{{ 'sections.footer.navigation' | t }}">
        {%- comment -%} ---- Jewellery ---- {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- liquid
          unless has_jewellery_menu
            assign jewellery_has_fallback = false
            if collections['rings'] != blank or collections['earrings'] != blank or necklaces_collection != blank or collections['bracelets'] != blank
              assign jewellery_has_fallback = true
            endif
          endunless
        -%}
        {%- if has_jewellery_menu or jewellery_has_fallback -%}
          <div class="caviera-footer__column" data-footer-accordion>
            <button type="button" class="caviera-footer__column-toggle label" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="FooterMenu-Jewellery-{{ section.id }}">
              {{ section.settings.footer_jewellery_heading | default: 'Jewellery' }}
            </button>
            <ul id="FooterMenu-Jewellery-{{ section.id }}" class="caviera-footer__column-list">
              {%- if has_jewellery_menu -%}
                {%- for link in section.settings.footer_jewellery_menu.links -%}<li><a href="{{ link.url }}">{{ link.title }}</a></li>{%- endfor -%}
              {%- else -%}
                {%- if collections['rings'] != blank -%}<li><a href="{{ collections['rings'].url }}">Rings</a></li>{%- endif -%}
                {%- if collections['earrings'] != blank -%}<li><a href="{{ collections['earrings'].url }}">Earrings</a></li>{%- endif -%}
                {%- if necklaces_collection != blank -%}<li><a href="{{ necklaces_collection.url }}">Necklaces</a></li>{%- endif -%}
                {%- if collections['bracelets'] != blank -%}<li><a href="{{ collections['bracelets'].url }}">Bracelets</a></li>{%- endif -%}
                <li><a href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}">Shop All</a></li>
              {%- endif -%}
            </ul>
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- comment -%} ---- The House ---- {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- liquid
          assign house_page = pages['about-caviera'] | default: pages['the-house']
          unless has_house_menu
            assign house_has_fallback = false
            if house_page != blank or pages['craftsmanship'] != blank or pages['bespoke'] != blank or house_journal != blank
              assign house_has_fallback = true
            endif
          endunless
        -%}
        {%- if has_house_menu or house_has_fallback -%}
          <div class="caviera-footer__column" data-footer-accordion>
            <button type="button" class="caviera-footer__column-toggle label" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="FooterMenu-House-{{ section.id }}">
              {{ section.settings.footer_house_heading | default: 'The House' }}
            </button>
            <ul id="FooterMenu-House-{{ section.id }}" class="caviera-footer__column-list">
              {%- if has_house_menu -%}
                {%- for link in section.settings.footer_house_menu.links -%}<li><a href="{{ link.url }}">{{ link.title }}</a></li>{%- endfor -%}
              {%- else -%}
                {%- if house_page != blank -%}<li><a href="{{ house_page.url }}">The House</a></li>{%- endif -%}
                {%- if pages['craftsmanship'] != blank -%}<li><a href="{{ pages['craftsmanship'].url }}">Craftsmanship</a></li>{%- endif -%}
                {%- if pages['bespoke'] != blank -%}<li><a href="{{ pages['bespoke'].url }}">Bespoke</a></li>{%- endif -%}
                {%- if house_journal != blank -%}<li><a href="{{ house_journal.url }}">Journal</a></li>{%- endif -%}
              {%- endif -%}
            </ul>
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- comment -%} ---- Client Care ---- {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- liquid
          unless has_client_care_menu
            assign client_care_has_fallback = false
            if pages['contact'] != blank or pages['faq'] != blank or pages['shipping'] != blank or pages['returns'] != blank or pages['care'] != blank
              assign client_care_has_fallback = true
            endif
          endunless
        -%}
        {%- if has_client_care_menu or client_care_has_fallback -%}
          <div class="caviera-footer__column" data-footer-accordion>
            <button type="button" class="caviera-footer__column-toggle label" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="FooterMenu-ClientCare-{{ section.id }}">
              {{ section.settings.footer_client_care_heading | default: 'Client Care' }}
            </button>
            <ul id="FooterMenu-ClientCare-{{ section.id }}" class="caviera-footer__column-list">
              {%- if has_client_care_menu -%}
                {%- for link in section.settings.footer_client_care_menu.links -%}<li><a href="{{ link.url }}">{{ link.title }}</a></li>{%- endfor -%}
              {%- else -%}
                {%- if pages['contact'] != blank -%}<li><a href="{{ pages['contact'].url }}">Contact Us</a></li>{%- endif -%}
                {%- if pages['faq'] != blank -%}<li><a href="{{ pages['faq'].url }}">FAQ</a></li>{%- endif -%}
                {%- if pages['shipping'] != blank -%}<li><a href="{{ pages['shipping'].url }}">Shipping</a></li>{%- endif -%}
                {%- if pages['returns'] != blank -%}<li><a href="{{ pages['returns'].url }}">Returns</a></li>{%- endif -%}
                {%- if pages['care'] != blank -%}<li><a href="{{ pages['care'].url }}">Care</a></li>{%- endif -%}
              {%- endif -%}
            </ul>
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- comment -%} ---- Information (policies) ---- {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- liquid
          unless has_information_menu
            assign information_has_fallback = false
            if shop.privacy_policy != blank or shop.terms_of_service != blank or shop.refund_policy != blank or shop.shipping_policy != blank
              assign information_has_fallback = true
            endif
          endunless
        -%}
        {%- if has_information_menu or information_has_fallback -%}
          <div class="caviera-footer__column" data-footer-accordion>
            <button type="button" class="caviera-footer__column-toggle label" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="FooterMenu-Information-{{ section.id }}">
              {{ section.settings.footer_information_heading | default: 'Information' }}
            </button>
            <ul id="FooterMenu-Information-{{ section.id }}" class="caviera-footer__column-list">
              {%- if has_information_menu -%}
                {%- for link in section.settings.footer_information_menu.links -%}<li><a href="{{ link.url }}">{{ link.title }}</a></li>{%- endfor -%}
              {%- else -%}
                {%- if shop.privacy_policy != blank -%}<li><a href="{{ shop.privacy_policy.url }}">{{ shop.privacy_policy.title }}</a></li>{%- endif -%}
                {%- if shop.terms_of_service != blank -%}<li><a href="{{ shop.terms_of_service.url }}">{{ shop.terms_of_service.title }}</a></li>{%- endif -%}
                {%- if shop.refund_policy != blank -%}<li><a href="{{ shop.refund_policy.url }}">{{ shop.refund_policy.title }}</a></li>{%- endif -%}
                {%- if shop.shipping_policy != blank -%}<li><a href="{{ shop.shipping_policy.url }}">{{ shop.shipping_policy.title }}</a></li>{%- endif -%}
              {%- endif -%}
            </ul>
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}
      </nav>
    {%- elsif request.design_mode -%}
      <div class="caviera-editor-note">No Shopify menus selected and no fallback resource (collection, page, blog or policy) could be detected for any group yet. Select menus above, or create the relevant pages/collections/policies, to populate the CAVIERA footer.</div>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- if section.settings.show_newsletter -%}
      <div class="caviera-footer__newsletter">
        <h3 class="label">{{ section.settings.newsletter_heading | default: 'general.newsletter.submit' | t }}</h3>
        {%- form 'customer', class: 'caviera-newsletter-form' -%}
          <input type="hidden" name="contact[tags]" value="newsletter">
          <label class="visually-hidden" for="FooterNewsletter">{{ 'general.newsletter.email_placeholder' | t }}</label>
          <div class="caviera-newsletter-form__row">
            <input type="email" id="FooterNewsletter" name="contact[email]" required placeholder="{{ 'general.newsletter.email_placeholder' | t }}" autocomplete="email">
            <button type="submit" class="btn">{{ 'general.newsletter.submit' | t }}</button>
          </div>
          <p class="caviera-footer__consent">{{ 'general.newsletter.consent' | t }}</p>
          {%- if form.posted_successfully? -%}
            <p class="form-status" data-state="success">{{ 'general.newsletter.success' | t }}</p>
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endform -%}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>

  <span class="caviera-footer__rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>

  <div class="container caviera-footer__bottom">
    <div class="caviera-footer__bottom-mark">
      {%- render 'caviera-wordmark', mode: mark_mode, width: 140 -%}
    </div>
    {%- if section.settings.social_show -%}
      <div class="caviera-footer__social">
        {%- if settings.social_instagram != blank -%}<a href="{{ settings.social_instagram }}" aria-label="Instagram">{% render 'icon', name: 'instagram' %}</a>{%- endif -%}
        {%- if settings.social_pinterest != blank -%}<a href="{{ settings.social_pinterest }}" aria-label="Pinterest">{% render 'icon', name: 'pinterest' %}</a>{%- endif -%}
        {%- if settings.social_facebook != blank -%}<a href="{{ settings.social_facebook }}" aria-label="Facebook">{% render 'icon', name: 'facebook' %}</a>{%- endif -%}
        {%- if settings.social_tiktok != blank -%}<a href="{{ settings.social_tiktok }}" aria-label="TikTok">{% render 'icon', name: 'tiktok' %}</a>{%- endif -%}
        {%- if settings.social_youtube != blank -%}<a href="{{ settings.social_youtube }}" aria-label="YouTube">{% render 'icon', name: 'youtube' %}</a>{%- endif -%}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}
    {%- liquid
      assign has_multiple_markets = false
      if localization.available_countries.size > 1 or localization.available_languages.size > 1
        assign has_multiple_markets = true
      endif
    -%}
    {%- if section.settings.show_localization and has_multiple_markets -%}
      {%- render 'localization-form', context: 'Footer' -%}
    {%- endif -%}
    <p class="caviera-footer__copyright">&copy; {{ 'now' | date: '%Y' }} {{ shop.name }}</p>
    {%- if section.settings.show_payment_icons -%}
      <ul class="caviera-footer__payment">
        {%- for type in shop.enabled_payment_types -%}
          <li>{{ type | payment_type_svg_tag: class: 'payment-icon' }}</li>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </ul>
    {%- endif -%}
    <span class="caviera-footer__seal">{%- render 'caviera-house-seal', mode: mark_mode, width: 24, alt: '' -%}</span>
  </div>
</footer>

<script src="{{ 'caviera-footer.js' | asset_url }}" defer="defer"></script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Footer",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "select", "id": "color_scheme", "label": "Colour", "default": "obsidian",
      "options": [
        { "value": "obsidian", "label": "Obsidian" },
        { "value": "cinnabar", "label": "Cinnabar" },
        { "value": "bone", "label": "Warm Bone" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "select", "id": "logo_scheme", "label": "Identity colour version", "default": "dark",
      "info": "Applies to the Master Signature, wordmark and House Seal below.",
      "options": [
        { "value": "light", "label": "For light backgrounds" },
        { "value": "dark", "label": "For dark backgrounds" }
      ]
    },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Formal signature" },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "show_master_signature", "label": "Show Master Signature moment", "default": true, "info": "The formal opening of the footer — House Seal + wordmark composed, with a headline. The plain wordmark appears again, smaller, near the bottom as the everyday utility mark." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "master_heading", "label": "Signature heading", "default": "Sculpted for a lifetime." },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "statement", "label": "Short house statement", "default": "A modern jewellery house shaped by precision, material and ritual." },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "social_show", "label": "Show social links", "default": true },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "show_localization", "label": "Show country/language selector", "default": false, "info": "Only appears when the store has more than one market or language configured." },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "show_payment_icons", "label": "Show payment icons", "default": false },

    { "type": "header", "content": "Footer navigation" },
    { "type": "paragraph", "content": "Select the Shopify menus displayed in each footer column. Menu selection is optional — leave any (or all) blank and that column automatically shows safe fallback links built from your store's existing collections, pages, blog and policies instead. A selected menu always takes priority over its fallback." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Jewellery menu" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "footer_jewellery_heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Jewellery" },
    { "type": "link_list", "id": "footer_jewellery_menu", "label": "Jewellery menu", "info": "Optional. Falls back to Rings/Earrings/Necklaces/Bracelets/Shop All where those collections exist." },

    { "type": "header", "content": "The House menu" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "footer_house_heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "The House" },
    { "type": "link_list", "id": "footer_house_menu", "label": "The House menu", "info": "Optional. Falls back to The House/Craftsmanship/Bespoke/Journal where those pages exist." },

    { "type": "header", "content": "Client Care menu" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "footer_client_care_heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Client Care" },
    { "type": "link_list", "id": "footer_client_care_menu", "label": "Client Care menu", "info": "Optional. Falls back to Contact Us/FAQ/Shipping/Returns/Care where those pages exist." },

    { "type": "header", "content": "Information menu" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "footer_information_heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Information" },
    { "type": "link_list", "id": "footer_information_menu", "label": "Information / Legal menu", "info": "Optional. Falls back to your store's own Privacy/Terms/Refund/Shipping policies where configured." },

    { "type": "header", "content": "Newsletter" },
    { "type": "paragraph", "content": "Leave off if the homepage Newsletter section is already enabled, so the form does not repeat on the homepage." },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "show_newsletter", "label": "Show newsletter form in footer", "default": false },
    { "type": "text", "id": "newsletter_heading", "label": "Newsletter heading" }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
